  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_2873.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves la conferencia Astronom&iacute;a, una ciencia al alcance de todos, a cargo de Jordi Art&eacute;s P&eacute;rez, director del Planetario de Castell&oacute;n, presentado por Rub&eacute;n Cerezuela.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/conferenciantejordiartesypresentadorrubencerezuela.jpg\" alt=\"conferenciantejordiartesypresentadorrubencerezuela\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/img_2873.jpg\" alt=\"img_2873\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/img_2875.jpg\" alt=\"img_2875\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/img_2876.jpg\" alt=\"img_2876\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/img_2877.jpg\" alt=\"img_2877\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/img_2878.jpg\" alt=\"img_2878\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciaplanetaricastelloateneuonda/img_2879.jpg\" alt=\"img_2879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
